# Root scratch, round 4 (2026-09-22). These are root-anchored globs rather than
# exact names so the next one-shot codemod or log dump can't be re-tracked.
# Durable tools belong in scripts/ or tools/, audits in docs/audits/.
/fix_*
/fix-*
/patch_*
/patch-*
/split_*
/split-*
/test.js
/test_*
/inspect-*
/lint-*
/lint_*
/review_*
/*_old.*
/*.patch
/*.txt
!/REFACTORING_FINAL_SUMMARY.txt
/REPORT_*.md
# Shell accidents: `npm … > candy_world@1.0.0`, `… > vite`
/*@*
/vite
